<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Douglass returns three months after his last review. His voice recovered fully within ten days of the laryngitis in June. He writes most days with pain of about 2 of 10, uses the gel once a day or less, and does his exercises most days. He sleeps about seven hours on five or six nights a week and has had one nightmare in the past month. He traveled to speak several times this summer and planned each trip with care; he felt watchful on the road, as he expects to, and slept well at home. He agreed to today&apos;s questionnaires and examination. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hand</td><td>Pain 2 of 10 with daily writing; FIHOA 4 of 30; gel once a day or less</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About seven hours on five or six nights a week; one nightmare in the past month</td></tr><tr><td>Scores</td><td>PCL-5 16; PHQ-9 2</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

